/Write a MARIE program to load the characters (into the AC) one-by-one 
/using indirect addressing (LoadI) 
/and modify the character by manipulating the ASCII code (adding ‘1’ to the ASCII value) 
/and store the character back into the same memory location using StoreI command. 
/Verify the changed ASCII values in the MARIE memory.
/loadi进具体的字符值，然后加一，然后存储到原先的地址中，最后输出
Loop,       LoadI myAdd
            skipcond 400    /如果是0，跳过下一行
            Jump modify
            Halt
modify,     Add One
            StoreI myAdd
            Output
            Load myAdd
            Add One
            Store myAdd
            Jump Loop

One,        Hex 1
myAdd,      ADR myName      /地址指针
myName,     Hex 04A   /J
            Hex 06F   /o
            Hex 068   /h
            Hex 06E   /n
            Hex 04E   /N
            Hex 06F   /o
            Hex 061   /a
            Hex 068   /h
            Hex 0     /0，退出字符